-- Migration: 00095_insights_four_per_category
-- Description: Expands the STRATIFIT Insights Content Master from one article
--              per category to four articles per category across all seven
--              categories (strategy, design-ux, web-development, ai-automation,
--              branding, growth-marketing, technology), fully translated in
--              en, de, fr, es. Adds 21 new evergreen articles plus their
--              category links. Existing articles are left untouched.
-- Stratifit Digital Agency Platform

